  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Currently in fcrepo-storage-ocfl, the DefaultOcflObjectSessionFactory only supports MutableOcflRepository in the constrcutor.  There are cases where we will want to use this class (or possibly another implementation of OcflObjectSessionFactory) to construct an immutable session factory.  For example in the case of performing read only validations with tools such as fcrepo-migration-validator.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
